Build NVIDIA 595.104.02 against Linux 7.4.

7.4 removes VM_SPECIAL, renames is_vm_hugetlb_page() to vma_is_hugetlb(), moves
drm_fb_helper.h to drm/clients/drm_fbdev_helper.h and replaces the plane and CRTC
.reset callbacks with .atomic_create_state. Older kernels keep their existing paths.

Ported from NVIDIA/open-gpu-kernel-modules PR 1414 (written for 615.71.09, not merged);
its dmem hunks are dropped because 595 has no dmem code. Remove this patch once
NVIDIA ships 7.4 support.

